    values:originalText "Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms." ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sec-4-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Review of operation of amendments made by Schedule 3"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-4-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister must cause an independent review to be undertaken of the operation of the amendments made by Schedule 3 to this Act. (2) The review must commence as soon as practicable after the end of the period of 24 months starting at the commencement of that Schedule. (3) The persons who undertake the review must give the Minister a written report of the review within 6 months of the commencement of the review. (4) The Minister must cause a copy of the report of the review to be tabled in each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that House after the report is given to the Minister.  Schedule 1  Privacy reforms" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister must cause an independent review to be undertaken of the operation of the amendments made by Schedule 3 to this Act. (2) The review must commence as soon as practicable after the end of the period of 24 months starting at the commencement of that Schedule. (3) The persons who undertake the review must give the Minister a written report of the review within 6 months of the commencement of the review. (4) The Minister must cause a copy of the report of the review to be tabled in each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that House after the report is given to the Minister.  Schedule 1  Privacy reforms"@en ;
