    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, in writing, direct the Commissioner to develop an APP code (a temporary APP code) if the Minister is satisfied that: (a) it is in the public interest: (i) to develop the code; and (ii) for the Commissioner to develop the code; and (b) the code should be developed urgently." ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-1-sec-26gb-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26GB(2) Development of APP codes by the Commissioner—temporary"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-26gb-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a direction under that subsection may: (a) specify one or more matters that the code must deal with; and (b) specify the APP entities, or a class of APP entities, that should be bound by the code." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a direction under that subsection may: (a) specify one or more matters that the code must deal with; and (b) specify the APP entities, or a class of APP entities, that should be bound by the code."@en ;
