    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-26gb-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) However, despite paragraph 26C(3)(b), the temporary APP code must not cover an act or practice that is exempt within the meaning of subsection 7B(1), (2) or (3). Consultation etc." ;
