concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-1-sec-80ka-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80KA(4) Matters covered by declarations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-80ka-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Without limiting subsection (3), any of the following may be specified as a permitted purpose in relation to an emergency or disaster: (a) identifying individuals who: (i) are or may be injured, missing or dead as a result of the emergency or disaster; or  Schedule 1  Privacy reforms" ;
