concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-1-sec-21 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21 Paragraphs 80P(1)(b) to (e)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-21 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraphs, substitute: (b) the collection, use or disclosure is for a permitted purpose specified in the declaration; and (c) the information is information of a kind specified in the declaration; and (d) the information is disclosed by an entity specified in the declaration, or an entity included in a class of entities specified in the declaration; and  Schedule 1  Privacy reforms" ;
