    values:originalText "(2) An entity is not liable to any proceedings for contravening a secrecy provision in respect of a use or disclosure of personal information authorised by subsection (1) unless the secrecy provision is a designated secrecy provision (see subsection (6))." ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer .

