concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-1-sec-26xb-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26XB(5) Authorisation of collection, use and disclosure of personal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-26xb-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A collection, use or disclose of personal information by an officer or employee of an agency in the course of duty as an officer or employee is authorised by subsection (1) only if the officer or employee is authorised by the agency to collect, use or disclose the personal information." ;
    skos:definition "(5) A collection, use or disclose of personal information by an officer or employee of an agency in the course of duty as an officer or employee is authorised by subsection (1) only if the officer or employee is authorised by the agency to collect, use or disclose the personal information."@en ;
