concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-1-sec-26xb-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26XB(6) Authorisation of collection, use and disclosure of personal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-26xb-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) In this section: designated secrecy provision means any of the following: (a) sections 18, 18A, 18B, 34GF, 35P, 92 and 92A, and subsection 34GE(4), of the Australian Security Intelligence Organisation Act 1979; (b) section 15LC of the Crimes Act 1914; (c) section 34 of the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security Act 1986; (d) sections 39, 40C, 40D and 41 of, and clause 9 of Schedule 1 to, the Intelligence Services Act 2001; (e) sections 42 and 44 of the Office of National Intelligence Act 2018; (f) sections 22, 22A and 22B of the Witness Protection Act 1994;  Schedule 1  Privacy reforms" ;
    skos:definition "(6) In this section: designated secrecy provision means any of the following: (a) sections 18, 18A, 18B, 34GF, 35P, 92 and 92A, and subsection 34GE(4), of the Australian Security Intelligence Organisation Act 1979; (b) section 15LC of the Crimes Act 1914; (c) section 34 of the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security Act 1986; (d) sections 39, 40C, 40D and 41 of, and clause 9 of Schedule 1 to, the Intelligence Services Act 2001; (e) sections 42 and 44 of the Office of National Intelligence Act 2018; (f) sections 22, 22A and 22B of the Witness Protection Act 1994;  Schedule 1  Privacy reforms"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c171c06846925b5264970b11748327b5b37d841ade0c34b28722cb02095eda69" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-1-sec-26xb ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Authorises collection, use and disclosure of personal information" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
