doc:sch-1-sec-26xf-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "26XF(4) Additional operation of this Division" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) This Division also has the effect it would have if a reference to a collection, use or disclosure were expressly confined to a collection, use or disclosure that occurs in the course of, or in relation to, the carrying on of the business of insurance (within the meaning of paragraph 51(xiv) of the Constitution), other than State insurance not extending beyond the limits of the State concerned. Trade and commerce" ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-1-sec-26xf-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26XF(5) Additional operation of this Division"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-26xf-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) This Division also has the effect it would have if a reference to a collection, use or disclosure were expressly confined to a collection, use or disclosure that occurs in the course of, or in relation to, trade or commerce: (a) between Australia and places outside Australia; or (b) among the States; or (c) within a Territory, between a State and a Territory or between 2 Territories.  Privacy reforms  Schedule 1 Eligible data breaches  Part 7 No. 128, 2024 Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024 Communications" ;
    skos:definition "(5) This Division also has the effect it would have if a reference to a collection, use or disclosure were expressly confined to a collection, use or disclosure that occurs in the course of, or in relation to, trade or commerce: (a) between Australia and places outside Australia; or (b) among the States; or (c) within a Territory, between a State and a Territory or between 2 Territories.  Privacy reforms  Schedule 1 Eligible data breaches  Part 7 No. 128, 2024 Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024 Communications"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "649b23d88a83059feed0e28f17ad14fd5367e51be794e7e5f3111e6387fda633" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-1-sec-26xf ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Eligible data breaches must be reported to the relevant authorities." ;
