    skos:prefLabel "26XF(8) Additional operation of this Division"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-26xf-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) This Division also has the effect it would have if a reference to a collection, use or disclosure were expressly confined to: (a) a collection, use or disclosure by an alien (within the meaning of paragraph 51(xix) of the Constitution); or (b) a collection, use or disclosure of personal information about an alien (within the meaning of paragraph 51(xix) of the Constitution). External affairs" ;
