concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-1-sec-44 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44 Application provision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-44 ;
    values:originalText "Division 5 of Part IIIC of the Privacy Act 1988, as inserted by this Part, applies in relation to: (a) eligible data breaches that happen on or after the commencement of this Part; and (b) information collected, used or disclosed after the commencement of this Part, regardless of whether the information was acquired or created before or after that commencement.  Privacy reforms  Schedule 1 Penalties for interference with privacy  Part 8 No. 128, 2024 Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024" ;
    skos:definition "Division 5 of Part IIIC of the Privacy Act 1988, as inserted by this Part, applies in relation to: (a) eligible data breaches that happen on or after the commencement of this Part; and (b) information collected, used or disclosed after the commencement of this Part, regardless of whether the information was acquired or created before or after that commencement.  Privacy reforms  Schedule 1 Penalties for interference with privacy  Part 8 No. 128, 2024 Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bc650d03b172c0ad0d9d9ae0b5827a2cd0a19188f2d7ea7c17f786f0df41958b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "34"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Division applies in relation to eligible data breaches and information collected, used or disclosed after commencement." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024.pdf> ;
    dc:source "privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024.pdf, p.34" ;
    cml:asserts concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-1-sec-44-norm .
