concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-1-sec-13h a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13H Civil penalty provision for interference with privacy of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-13h ;
    values:originalText "individuals Civil penalty provision (1) An entity contravenes this subsection if the entity does an act, or engages in a practice, that is an interference with the privacy of an individual. (2) Subsection (1) is a civil penalty provision. Note: Section 80U deals with civil penalty provisions in this Act. Maximum pecuniary penalty (3) The amount of the penalty payable by a person in respect of a contravention of subsection (1) must not exceed 2,000 penalty units." ;
    skos:definition "individuals Civil penalty provision (1) An entity contravenes this subsection if the entity does an act, or engages in a practice, that is an interference with the privacy of an individual. (2) Subsection (1) is a civil penalty provision. Note: Section 80U deals with civil penalty provisions in this Act. Maximum pecuniary penalty (3) The amount of the penalty payable by a person in respect of a contravention of subsection (1) must not exceed 2,000 penalty units."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8aeffd2f65890688d7b8c62dec79c9dfe3ef2ab712f7ae0940e16bfad47ca06c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "37"^^xsd:integer ;
