doc:sch-1-sec-80uc-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "80UC(1) Compliance notices" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) Any of the following persons may give an entity a notice if the person reasonably believes that the entity has contravened subsection 13K(1) or (2) (civil penalty provision for which infringement notices or compliance notices can be issued): (a) the Commissioner; (b) a member of the staff of the Commissioner who holds, or is acting in, an office or position that is equivalent to an SES employee. Note: The notice may be varied or revoked under subsection 33(3) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer .

