concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-1-sec-58 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "58 Application of amendments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-58 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendments of section 13G of the Privacy Act 1988 made by this Part apply in relation to acts done, or practices engaged in, after the commencement of this item. (2) Sections 13H, 13J, 13K, 80UC and 80UD of the Privacy Act 1988, as inserted by this Part, and the amendments of section 80UB of the Privacy Act 1988 made by this Part, apply in relation to acts done, or practices engaged in, after the commencement of this item.  Schedule 1  Privacy reforms" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The amendments of section 13G of the Privacy Act 1988 made by this Part apply in relation to acts done, or practices engaged in, after the commencement of this item. (2) Sections 13H, 13J, 13K, 80UC and 80UD of the Privacy Act 1988, as inserted by this Part, and the amendments of section 80UB of the Privacy Act 1988 made by this Part, apply in relation to acts done, or practices engaged in, after the commencement of this item.  Schedule 1  Privacy reforms"@en ;
