concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-1-sec-60 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "60 Application of amendments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-60 ;
    values:originalText "Section 80UA of the Privacy Act 1988, as inserted by this Part, applies in relation to proceedings instituted after the commencement of this Part, whether the contravention to which the proceedings relate is alleged to have occurred before, on or after that commencement.  Schedule 1  Privacy reforms" ;
