concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-1-sec-64 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "64 Application of amendments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-64 ;
    values:originalText "Division 3B of Part IV of the Privacy Act 1988, as inserted by this Part, applies in relation to public inquiries commenced on or after the commencement of this Part, whether the matter to which the inquiry relates arose, before or after that commencement.  Schedule 1  Privacy reforms" ;
