concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-1-sec-80tc a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80TC Modifications of Part 2 of the Regulatory Powers Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-80tc ;
    values:originalText "Use of force in executing a monitoring warrant In executing a monitoring warrant under Part 2 of the Regulatory Powers Act, as that Part applies in relation to the provisions mentioned in subsection 80TB(1), the information mentioned in  Privacy reforms  Schedule 1 Monitoring and investigation  Part 14 No. 128, 2024 Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024 subsection 80TB(2), and the matters mentioned in subsection 80TB(3), of this Act: (a) an authorised person may use such force against things as is necessary and reasonable in the circumstances; and (b) a person assisting the authorised person may use such force against things as is necessary and reasonable in the circumstances. Division 1AC—Investigation powers" ;
    skos:definition "Use of force in executing a monitoring warrant In executing a monitoring warrant under Part 2 of the Regulatory Powers Act, as that Part applies in relation to the provisions mentioned in subsection 80TB(1), the information mentioned in  Privacy reforms  Schedule 1 Monitoring and investigation  Part 14 No. 128, 2024 Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024 subsection 80TB(2), and the matters mentioned in subsection 80TB(3), of this Act: (a) an authorised person may use such force against things as is necessary and reasonable in the circumstances; and (b) a person assisting the authorised person may use such force against things as is necessary and reasonable in the circumstances. Division 1AC—Investigation powers"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7735415e757539d0c2d687d6716eb293bd2fff12be68d646d82c471964f8e257" ;
    cof:pageNumber "58"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Use of force in executing a monitoring warrant" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
