concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-1-sec-1-4-logic-deontic-6 a cml:LogicApplication ;
    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    cml:operator "includes" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Granting a benefit is also a decision that affects individual rights or interests." ;
    cml:premiseText "(i) a decision made under a provision of an Act or a legislative instrument to grant, or to refuse to grant, a benefit to the individual;" ;
    cml:conclusionText "Granting a benefit is an obligation." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::logic::deontic" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sch-1-sec-1-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "1 9 For the purposes of subclauses 1.7 and 1.8:" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(a) making a decision includes refusing or failing to make a decision; and  Privacy reforms  Schedule 1 Automated decisions and privacy policies  Part 15 No. 128, 2024 Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024 (b) doing a thing includes refusing or failing to do a thing; and (c) a decision may affect the rights or interests of an individual, whether the rights or interests of the individual are adversely or beneficially affected; and (d) the following are examples of the kinds of decisions that may affect the rights or interests of an individual: (i) a decision made under a provision of an Act or a legislative instrument to grant, or to refuse to grant, a benefit to the individual; (ii) a decision that affects the individual’s rights under a contract, agreement or arrangement; (iii) a decision that affects the individual’s access to a significant service or support." ;
    cof:pageNumber "64"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-1-sec-89 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "89 Application of amendment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-89 ;
    values:originalText "The amendment of clause 1 of Schedule 1 to the Privacy Act 1988 made by this Part applies in relation to decisions made after the commencement of this item, whether: (a) the arrangement for a computer program to make the decision, or do a thing that is substantially and directly related to making the decision, was made before or after that commencement; and (b) the use of personal information in the operation of the computer program occurred before or after that commencement; and (c) the personal information used in the operation of the computer program was acquired or created before or after that commencement.  Schedule 2  Serious invasions of privacy  Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024 No. 128, 2024" ;
    skos:definition "The amendment of clause 1 of Schedule 1 to the Privacy Act 1988 made by this Part applies in relation to decisions made after the commencement of this item, whether: (a) the arrangement for a computer program to make the decision, or do a thing that is substantially and directly related to making the decision, was made before or after that commencement; and (b) the use of personal information in the operation of the computer program occurred before or after that commencement; and (c) the personal information used in the operation of the computer program was acquired or created before or after that commencement.  Schedule 2  Serious invasions of privacy  Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024 No. 128, 2024"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2495672bef076d18cedf8e6eb64056fede82bde74b9c558b26dfec00d551be5b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "65"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application of amendment" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024.pdf> ;
    dc:source "privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024.pdf, p.65" ;
    cml:asserts concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-1-sec-89-norm .
