doc:sch-2-sec-8-2-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "8(1) Defences" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) It is a defence to the cause of action if: (a) the invasion of privacy was required or authorised by or under an Australian law or court/tribunal order; or (b) the plaintiff, or a person having lawful authority to do so for the plaintiff, expressly or impliedly consented to the invasion of privacy; or (c) the defendant reasonably believed that the invasion of privacy was necessary to prevent or lessen a serious threat to the life, health or safety of a person; or (d) the invasion of privacy was: (i) incidental to the exercise of a lawful right of defence of persons or property; and (ii) proportionate, necessary and reasonable." ;
    cof:pageNumber "75"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-2-sec-8-2-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8(2) Defences"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-8-2-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) It is also a defence to the cause of action if: (a) the defendant invaded the plaintiff’s privacy by publishing, within the meaning of an Australian law that deals with defamation, information that relates to the plaintiff; and (b) the Australian law provides for a related defence; and (c) the defendant would be able to establish the related defence if a reference in the Australian law to the publication of defamatory matter were to include a reference to the invasion of privacy.  Schedule 2  Serious invasions of privacy  Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024 No. 128, 2024" ;
    skos:definition "(2) It is also a defence to the cause of action if: (a) the defendant invaded the plaintiff’s privacy by publishing, within the meaning of an Australian law that deals with defamation, information that relates to the plaintiff; and (b) the Australian law provides for a related defence; and (c) the defendant would be able to establish the related defence if a reference in the Australian law to the publication of defamatory matter were to include a reference to the invasion of privacy.  Schedule 2  Serious invasions of privacy  Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024 No. 128, 2024"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b6fb3d86bc4bc28315d9f6d6dd13d7674534151d716d57002512a1a426dc6d4a" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-2-sec-8-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "75"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defence to the cause of action if defendant invaded plaintiff's privacy by publishing information related to the plaintiff." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
