concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-2-sec-8-2-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8(3) Defences"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-8-2-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Each of the following is a related defence for the purposes of this clause: (a) a defence of absolute privilege; (b) a defence for publication of public documents; (c) a defence of fair report of proceedings of public concern." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Each of the following is a related defence for the purposes of this clause: (a) a defence of absolute privilege; (b) a defence for publication of public documents; (c) a defence of fair report of proceedings of public concern."@en ;
