concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-2-sec-10-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 Summary judgment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-10-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The court may give judgment for the defendant if the court is satisfied that the plaintiff has no reasonable prospect of successfully prosecuting the proceedings.  Serious invasions of privacy  Schedule 2  No. 128, 2024 Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024 (2) This clause does not limit any powers that the court has apart from this clause." ;
