doc:sch-2-sec-15-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "15(3) Journalists etc." ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Material is journalistic material if it: (a) has the character of news, current affairs or a documentary; or (b) consists of commentary or opinion on, or analysis of, news, current affairs or a documentary; or (c) consists of editorial content relating to news, current affairs or a documentary." ;
    cof:pageNumber "79"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-2-sec-15-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15(4) Journalists etc."@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-15-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of this clause, if a journalist invades an individual’s privacy, it is immaterial whether the invasion of privacy breaches the standards or the code of practice to which the journalist is subject." ;
    skos:definition "(4) For the purposes of this clause, if a journalist invades an individual’s privacy, it is immaterial whether the invasion of privacy breaches the standards or the code of practice to which the journalist is subject."@en ;
