concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-2-sec-16 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16 Agencies and State and Territory authorities (other than"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-16 ;
    values:originalText "intelligence agencies and law enforcement bodies) This Schedule does not apply to an invasion of an individual’s privacy by an agency or a State or Territory authority (other than an intelligence agency or a law enforcement body) to the extent that the agency or authority invades the individual’s privacy, in good faith: (a) in the performance or purported performance of a function of the agency or authority; or (b) in the exercise or purported exercise of a power of the agency or authority.  Serious invasions of privacy  Schedule 2  No. 128, 2024 Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024" ;
    skos:definition "intelligence agencies and law enforcement bodies) This Schedule does not apply to an invasion of an individual’s privacy by an agency or a State or Territory authority (other than an intelligence agency or a law enforcement body) to the extent that the agency or authority invades the individual’s privacy, in good faith: (a) in the performance or purported performance of a function of the agency or authority; or (b) in the exercise or purported exercise of a power of the agency or authority.  Serious invasions of privacy  Schedule 2  No. 128, 2024 Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7e01ff60dfcb2f178b67d3f5ea8a753aa7cc940bc81db186f16c47e6c138160c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "80"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "No serious invasions of privacy by State and Territory authorities (excluding intelligence agencies and law enforcement bodies) in good faith." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
