concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-2-sec-16b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16B Law enforcement bodies"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-16b ;
    values:originalText "This Schedule does not apply to: (a) an invasion of privacy by a law enforcement body; or (b) an invasion of privacy by a person who is a staff member of a law enforcement body in the performance of the person’s duties, powers or functions as such a staff member; or (c) an invasion of privacy to the extent that it involves a disclosure of information to a law enforcement body; or (d) an invasion of privacy to the extent that it involves information that was disclosed by a law enforcement body." ;
    skos:definition "This Schedule does not apply to: (a) an invasion of privacy by a law enforcement body; or (b) an invasion of privacy by a person who is a staff member of a law enforcement body in the performance of the person’s duties, powers or functions as such a staff member; or (c) an invasion of privacy to the extent that it involves a disclosure of information to a law enforcement body; or (d) an invasion of privacy to the extent that it involves information that was disclosed by a law enforcement body."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2451c08c9caafe8ad94cda2fca72d33b338c4a53c6ada85a4a29910e318b5148" ;
    cof:pageNumber "81"^^xsd:integer ;
