doc:sch-2-sec-19-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "19(4) Single publication rule" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) In this clause: associate, of a publisher, means: (a) an employee of the publisher; or (b) a person who publishes information as a contractor of the publisher; or (c) an associated entity of the publisher; or  Serious invasions of privacy  Schedule 2  No. 128, 2024 Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024 (d) an employee of an associated entity of the publisher; or (e) a person who publishes information as a contractor of an associated entity of the publisher. associated entity has the same meaning as in the Corporations Act 2001." ;
    cof:pageNumber "82"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-2-sec-20 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20 Deceased persons"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-20 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person (including a personal representative of a deceased person) cannot assert, continue or enforce an action under this Schedule in relation to: (a) an invasion of the privacy of a deceased person (whether occurring before or after the deceased person’s death); or (b) an invasion of privacy by a person who has died. (2) Nothing in this clause prevents the court, if it considers it in the interests of justice to do so, from determining the question of costs for proceedings discontinued because of this clause." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person (including a personal representative of a deceased person) cannot assert, continue or enforce an action under this Schedule in relation to: (a) an invasion of the privacy of a deceased person (whether occurring before or after the deceased person’s death); or (b) an invasion of privacy by a person who has died. (2) Nothing in this clause prevents the court, if it considers it in the interests of justice to do so, from determining the question of costs for proceedings discontinued because of this clause."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e39a6fbace5c6a0502b1a8624ea6086731a990145bd10c7465fb74aec7958f7e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "83"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-2-sec-20-ss-1 ;
