concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-2-sec-23 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23 Jurisdiction"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-23 ;
    values:originalText "Federal and State courts (1) Jurisdiction is conferred on the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) in relation to matters arising under this Schedule.  Schedule 2  Serious invasions of privacy  Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024 No. 128, 2024 Note: State courts and the Federal Court of Australia also have jurisdiction in relation to matters arising under this Schedule (see subsection 39(2) and paragraph 39B(1A)(c) of the Judiciary Act 1903). Territory courts (2) Jurisdiction is conferred on the courts of the Territories in relation to matters arising under this Schedule. (3) Jurisdiction is conferred under subclause (2): (a) only so far as the Constitution permits; and (b) within the limits (other than limits of locality) of the jurisdiction of the court (whether those limits are limits as to subject matter or otherwise).  Doxxing offences  Schedule 3  No. 128, 2024 Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024" ;
    skos:definition "Federal and State courts (1) Jurisdiction is conferred on the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) in relation to matters arising under this Schedule.  Schedule 2  Serious invasions of privacy  Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024 No. 128, 2024 Note: State courts and the Federal Court of Australia also have jurisdiction in relation to matters arising under this Schedule (see subsection 39(2) and paragraph 39B(1A)(c) of the Judiciary Act 1903). Territory courts (2) Jurisdiction is conferred on the courts of the Territories in relation to matters arising under this Schedule. (3) Jurisdiction is conferred under subclause (2): (a) only so far as the Constitution permits; and (b) within the limits (other than limits of locality) of the jurisdiction of the court (whether those limits are limits as to subject matter or otherwise).  Doxxing offences  Schedule 3  No. 128, 2024 Privacy and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2024"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e983ac2991364252da43133589db10f8ef66d69e5f2e14bf8ad62fefb03df486" ;
    cof:pageNumber "83"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-2-sec-23-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-2-sec-23-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024-sch-2-sec-23-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024.pdf> ;
    dc:source "privacy-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2024.pdf, p.83" .
